Description: palOS system identity
 Names the system palOS 27 everywhere it introduces itself: /etc/os-release
 (About This Computer, hostnamectl, lsb_release), the boot menu, the
 text-mode boot screen and the console login banner. palOS is made by
 Joe Lucas. The .deb package format, apt, PPAs and drivers keep working
 because the system's package-compatibility keys are left in place.
 .
 Also keeps the stock upgrade, subscription and crash-report tools off the
 system (the palOS Store handles apps, snaps, updates and drivers).
